1
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,439
Why are you in such a hurry to leave?

2
00:01:40,719 --> 00:01:41,280
Yeah.

3
00:01:41,719 --> 00:01:42,599
That little brother

4
00:01:42,599 --> 00:01:43,799
is quite nice.

5
00:01:43,799 --> 00:01:45,000
And he's our fan.

6
00:01:45,439 --> 00:01:46,400
He has a problem.

7
00:01:47,599 --> 00:01:48,480
Don't you think

8
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:50,000
he was fishing for information just now?

9
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,040
If you don't believe me,

10
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:53,560
stay here later

11
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,519
and you'll see.

12
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:58,079
Fu Binyan.

13
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,000
Why are you still here?

14
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,120
I knew it was you.

15
00:02:04,359 --> 00:02:05,280
How did you get in?

16
00:02:08,439 --> 00:02:09,919
I just asked their captain

17
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:10,879
if I could come in.

18
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,479
And he said yes?

19
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,560
Maybe because

20
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,960
I help them with math.

21
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:20,599
Let's go.

22
00:02:20,599 --> 00:02:21,840
Xie Yizhou should be coming in.

23
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:28,800
Pass the ball.

24
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,400
Good, cool.

25
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:32,840
Hurry up, hurry up.

26
00:02:34,919 --> 00:02:35,479
Make up for it, make up for it.

27
00:02:35,479 --> 00:02:36,120
Go, go, go.

28
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:36,439
Shoot.

29
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:47,639
Coach.

30
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:48,840
Here.

31
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,000
Get ready to go on the field later.

32
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,240
Group A, off the court.

33
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,199
Group C, get ready.

34
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:55,039
It's him.

35
00:02:55,439 --> 00:02:56,199
Number 11.

36
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,759
It's really him.

37
00:03:05,319 --> 00:03:06,240
I knew it.

38
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:18,319
He's amazing.

39
00:03:18,479 --> 00:03:19,680
He's Xie Yizhou,

40
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:21,560
from the Middle School Affiliated to the Institute of Physical Education.

41
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:22,879
He's 14 years old.

42
00:03:23,439 --> 00:03:24,560
Don't be fooled by his age

43
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:26,759
and shorter stature.

44
00:03:26,759 --> 00:03:27,840
His strength

45
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,120
is the most dazzling

46
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,479
in the whole team.

47
00:03:34,199 --> 00:03:35,400
Are you okay?

48
00:03:37,479 --> 00:03:39,479
I seem to have seen him somewhere,

49
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,319
but I can't remember.

50
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:57,680
Cool.

51
00:03:59,879 --> 00:04:00,599
Those guys

52
00:04:00,599 --> 00:04:01,759
seem to be here again.

53
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,319
Should we go and drive them away?

54
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:05,719
It's okay. They are my friends.

55
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,439
Let them see for a while.

56
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,840
After all, the next time we meet

57
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:10,199
will be on the court.

58
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,519
Xie Yizhou

59
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:26,839
is so scary.

60
00:04:27,199 --> 00:04:28,879
He plays well,

61
00:04:28,879 --> 00:04:30,240
and he is so cunning.

62
00:04:30,639 --> 00:04:31,560
Shame.

63
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,879
So embarrassing.

64
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:33,920
I can't believe

65
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,040
I was fooled

66
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,079
by a 14-year-old kid.

67
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:42,120
Don't be nervous.

68
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,839
If I wanted to expose you,

69
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:44,480
I wouldn't have helped you

70
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,360
just now.

71
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,720
He's not only skilled,

72
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,399
but also good at psychology.

73
00:04:49,399 --> 00:04:51,000
He knows how to mislead the enemy

74
00:04:51,199 --> 00:04:52,560
and how to extract information.

75
00:04:52,759 --> 00:04:54,000
Senior Li Haoyu

76
00:04:54,279 --> 00:04:55,680
is good at quick breakthroughs.

77
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,759
Senior Lin Qingyuan

78
00:04:57,079 --> 00:04:58,279
has a high shooting accuracy.

79
00:04:58,279 --> 00:04:59,519
He trains every day.

80
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,120
What do you think?

81
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,759
You're right.

82
00:05:04,319 --> 00:05:06,040
Our new plan

83
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,040
is not enough.

84
00:05:08,279 --> 00:05:09,040
Why?

85
00:05:10,959 --> 00:05:12,879
Xie Yizhou has a good defensive awareness.

86
00:05:13,839 --> 00:05:15,319
He was constantly

87
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:17,120
monitoring his teammates' positions

88
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,600
and predicting the ball's trajectory.

89
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,000
If

90
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,839
we just spread out

91
00:05:20,839 --> 00:05:22,120
our attack,

92
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,560
he'll quickly

93
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:25,279
penetrate our defense.

94
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,439
What should we do?

95
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:28,959
You need to find someone

96
00:05:28,959 --> 00:05:30,160
with similar skills.

97
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,959
Gu Chenyang is a good choice.

98
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,079
His consciousness and speed

99
00:05:34,079 --> 00:05:35,319
are similar to his.

100
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,519
Yes.

101
00:05:38,519 --> 00:05:40,800
I also think we are similar.

102
00:05:41,639 --> 00:05:43,199
But I always feel

103
00:05:43,199 --> 00:05:44,639
he seems to know me.

104
00:05:49,639 --> 00:05:50,480
Know you?

105
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,240
I can't explain it.

106
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,519
It's just a feeling.

107
00:05:57,279 --> 00:05:58,319
I have to go back.

108
00:05:58,639 --> 00:05:59,920
It's so early.

109
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:02,759
My dad and I

110
00:06:02,759 --> 00:06:03,720
have a weekly meeting

111
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,000
every Friday at 7.

112
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,720
I'll discuss

113
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,680
Xie Yizhou's situation

114
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:08,759
with Coach Su later.

115
00:06:09,079 --> 00:06:10,199
You guys think of something too,

116
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,000
especially you,

117
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:12,920
Fu Binyan.

118
00:06:13,759 --> 00:06:14,560
Help us out.

119
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:29,079
Do you think Gu Chenyang

120
00:06:29,079 --> 00:06:29,560
has a similar work style

121
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,800
to your mom?

122
00:06:31,639 --> 00:06:32,199
No, not really.

123
00:06:33,399 --> 00:06:33,959
Why not?

124
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,920
My mom is a classic workaholic,

125
00:06:37,079 --> 00:06:39,000
the more she works, the more energized she gets.

126
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,199
But Gu Chenyang,

127
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:42,680
he doesn't seem like that.

128
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:44,040
Really?

129
00:06:44,439 --> 00:06:45,560
I thought he was born to be

130
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,560
a master of planning.

131
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,240
No, no, no.

132
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:49,399
He was as undisciplined as me

133
00:06:49,399 --> 00:06:50,439
when he was a child.

134
00:06:50,839 --> 00:06:51,560
Now he's really becoming

135
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,600
more and more like his father.

136
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,199
I'm still here

137
00:06:55,199 --> 00:06:56,199
wasting time with you.

138
00:06:56,199 --> 00:06:57,000
I'm leaving.

139
00:06:58,079 --> 00:06:59,040
Wait.

140
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,040
Please.

141
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,600
We need you.

142
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:02,560
Yeah.

143
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,560
Gu Chenyang said

144
00:07:03,839 --> 00:07:04,759
especially you.

145
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:06,160
Please help us.

146
00:07:11,839 --> 00:07:13,639
You told me to ask for help

147
00:07:13,639 --> 00:07:14,759
when I need it.

148
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,279
So

149
00:07:16,279 --> 00:07:17,319
please help us

150
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,079
to give us some advice.

151
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:26,560
Fine.

152
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:29,839
I can think of a way,

153
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,920
but you have to balance your studies.

154
00:07:41,639 --> 00:07:42,680
In this monthly quiz,

155
00:07:42,839 --> 00:07:44,519
I'm still the top in the grade,

156
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:46,480
but my total score

157
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:49,399
has dropped compared to before.

158
00:07:50,519 --> 00:07:51,879
The main problem

159
00:07:51,879 --> 00:07:52,639
is the last question

160
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:53,639
of math

161
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:54,720
and the English listening.

162
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,560
The reason for the decline in math

163
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,959
is that I didn't fully understand

164
00:07:57,959 --> 00:07:59,360
the knowledge points of the new unit.

165
00:07:59,839 --> 00:08:00,920
So from now on,

166
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,399
I will do an extra set of questions every day

167
00:08:02,399 --> 00:08:03,600
to reinforce and consolidate.

168
00:08:05,439 --> 00:08:06,639
The English listening

169
00:08:06,639 --> 00:08:08,639
was due to a lack of careful reading of the questions.

170
00:08:09,079 --> 00:08:10,639
In the future, I will also strengthen

171
00:08:10,639 --> 00:08:12,319
my practice of English listening.

172
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,399
Losing ten points in total

173
00:08:15,439 --> 00:08:16,720
is a very serious mistake.

174
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:17,480
Right?

175
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,560
Should it be taken as a lesson?

176
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,560
I will, Dad.

177
00:08:22,959 --> 00:08:23,959
Next,

178
00:08:23,959 --> 00:08:25,680
it's the monthly reading report.

179
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,800
This month, our school has launched

180
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,879
a reading week event.

181
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:30,879
I will read more books

182
00:08:30,879 --> 00:08:32,159
from the school's reading list.

183
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,240
This month, I read

184
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,360
The Catcher in the Rye

185
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,559
and Fu Lei's Family Letters.

186
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:37,960
The reading report

187
00:08:38,279 --> 00:08:39,879
has been sent to your email.

188
00:08:41,279 --> 00:08:42,240
I've seen it.

189
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,399
It's well written.

190
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:46,840
How's your tennis practice going?

191
00:08:47,919 --> 00:08:51,159
I'm still practicing tennis according to the plan.

192
00:08:52,399 --> 00:08:53,600
You must keep it up.

193
00:08:54,519 --> 00:08:56,399
If you're considering

194
00:08:56,679 --> 00:08:58,360
studying abroad,

195
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,720
tennis can be a big plus.

196
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:00,879
Okay?

197
00:09:00,879 --> 00:09:02,320
Of course, that's one thing.

198
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:03,159
Another is

199
00:09:03,799 --> 00:09:05,720
it shows your determination.

200
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,240
Dad,

201
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:09,200
actually, I think

202
00:09:09,279 --> 00:09:10,480
domestic academic planning

203
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,919
might be more suitable for me.

204
00:09:18,159 --> 00:09:19,120
I have a meeting.

205
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,120
Let's discuss it

206
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,960
when I return to China, okay?

207
00:09:24,399 --> 00:09:25,799
See you next week.

208
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,919
I'm looking forward to your good news.

209
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:39,840
You passed the exam.

210
00:10:23,279 --> 00:10:25,080
[Congratulations to our students]

211
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,360
[on winning awards]

212
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:28,120
[in the provincial high school students']

213
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:29,399
[mathematical Olympiad.]

214
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:31,279
Fu Binyan and Zhou Yang.

215
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:32,960
Who won the prize?

216
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,799
Zhou Yang and Fu Binyan in Grade 11.

217
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:37,080
They are amazing.

218
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,039
Not only that,

219
00:10:38,039 --> 00:10:39,320
they cooperate with each other.

220
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,320
How enviable!

221
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:51,879
It's been a long time

222
00:10:51,879 --> 00:10:53,399
since I've had the feeling of

223
00:10:53,399 --> 00:10:54,320
winning together.

224
00:10:57,879 --> 00:10:59,320
It's a pity

225
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,639
that it's not on the basketball court.

226
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:07,919
But it's already

227
00:11:07,919 --> 00:11:08,919
very good now.

228
00:11:10,399 --> 00:11:11,240
Pleasure working with you.

229
00:11:11,639 --> 00:11:12,519
Pleasure working with you.

230
00:11:28,279 --> 00:11:28,840
Fu Binyan.

231
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,600
Training is over.

232
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:35,120
Why don't you go back?

233
00:11:35,639 --> 00:11:36,600
I want to tell you something.

234
00:11:36,879 --> 00:11:37,600
What is it?

235
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,279
I know your secret.

236
00:11:48,279 --> 00:11:49,159
What secret?

237
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:51,919
When you play basketball,

238
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:52,879
you often smile.

239
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:54,320
You don't even know it yourself, do you?

240
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:57,559
That's all?

241
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:59,399
I've been watching you for a long time.

242
00:11:59,879 --> 00:12:01,519
You usually have a cold face,

243
00:12:01,519 --> 00:12:02,840
and everyone is a bit afraid of you.

244
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,879
But as long as you face basketball,

245
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:09,039
like this,

246
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,279
you really love basketball.

247
00:12:16,279 --> 00:12:17,159
You should pay more attention

248
00:12:17,159 --> 00:12:18,200
to your skills.

249
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,480
Delete the photos.

250
00:12:29,039 --> 00:12:30,240
You're all talk,

251
00:12:32,279 --> 00:12:33,120
but my camera

252
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,360
never lies.

253
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,799
Stop, stop!

254
00:12:48,279 --> 00:12:48,759
Li Haoyu,

255
00:12:48,759 --> 00:12:49,600
what was that

256
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:50,720
defense?

257
00:12:51,279 --> 00:12:52,279
Are you playing games?

258
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:54,679
Coach, I just want to intercept the ball.

259
00:12:54,679 --> 00:12:57,720
To intercept the ball, you need to stay calm.

260
00:12:58,279 --> 00:12:59,360
Don't be like an old lady

261
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,720
fighting for eggs in the supermarket.

262
00:13:01,279 --> 00:13:03,399
I'm adding extra practice for you tonight

263
00:13:03,399 --> 00:13:04,960
for the next game.

264
00:13:06,039 --> 00:13:07,120
Your cooperation

265
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:08,360
is crucial.

266
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:10,799
Whether it's offense or defense,

267
00:13:10,799 --> 00:13:12,279
you both need to step up.

268
00:13:12,279 --> 00:13:13,159
Understand?

269
00:13:13,399 --> 00:13:14,200
Yes, sir.

270
00:13:14,679 --> 00:13:15,399
One more time.

271
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:25,000
Watch out!

272
00:13:31,039 --> 00:13:32,080
Are you okay?

273
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,159
Where are you hurt?

274
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:34,960
My wrist.

275
00:13:36,679 --> 00:13:37,840
Don't move.

276
00:13:38,679 --> 00:13:39,360
Let me see.

277
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:41,840
Coach.

278
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:42,559
It hurts.

279
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:43,720
Let's go to the hospital.

280
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:44,360
OK.

281
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:57,080
Have some water.

282
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:04,639
I'm sorry

283
00:14:04,759 --> 00:14:05,840
for today.

284
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,279
I was careless

285
00:14:07,279 --> 00:14:08,559
and hurt you.

286
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:09,840
It's okay.

287
00:14:10,519 --> 00:14:11,600
I'll be fine in a couple of days.

288
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:15,759
Don't move around.

289
00:14:15,759 --> 00:14:16,759
Your hand's hurt.

290
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,759
Let me help you.

291
00:14:23,879 --> 00:14:25,639
Stop pushing yourself.

292
00:14:25,639 --> 00:14:27,200
The doctor said you need to rest.

293
00:14:28,039 --> 00:14:29,120
How can I rest?

294
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,200
Coach Su just said

295
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:30,559
we need to

296
00:14:30,559 --> 00:14:31,759
step up for the next game.

297
00:14:32,159 --> 00:14:33,519
Now my right hand's injured.

298
00:14:33,799 --> 00:14:35,080
I need to come up with a new plan.

299
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:35,679
Stop right there.

300
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:36,600
Gu Chenyang,

301
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:37,759
just

302
00:14:37,759 --> 00:14:38,919
take a break.

303
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:41,519
But without a new plan,

304
00:14:41,519 --> 00:14:42,600
I can't relax.

305
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:44,759
If you don't rest now,

306
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:46,360
we won't be able to relax either.

307
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,759
Drink some water, drink some water.

308
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:51,279
Chenyang, you're injured?

309
00:14:51,639 --> 00:14:52,639
Is it serious?

310
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:55,279
Auntie, you're finally back.

311
00:14:55,559 --> 00:14:56,559
Gu Chenyang's hand is swollen,

312
00:14:56,559 --> 00:14:57,600
and he's still working with it injured.

313
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:58,759
Please tell him to take a break.

314
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:01,600
Thank you, Haoyu.

315
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:02,960
I'll be on my way then.

316
00:15:03,559 --> 00:15:05,080
Gu Chenyang, take care of your hand.

317
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:06,039
Don't move it around.

318
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:07,960
Don't take the tablet away.

319
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:10,360
Let me see.

320
00:15:11,679 --> 00:15:12,840
Does it hurt?

321
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:13,960
Mom, I'm fine.

322
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,279
It's normal playing basketball.

323
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:17,759
How could you be so careless?

324
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:22,600
You still say you're fine.

325
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:25,279
I'm so worried about you.

326
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:27,679
Mom,

327
00:15:27,679 --> 00:15:29,039
I'll be more careful next time.

328
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:34,679
What do you want for dinner?

329
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:35,960
I'll cook for you.

330
00:15:36,399 --> 00:15:37,039
You need

331
00:15:37,039 --> 00:15:38,200
something light

332
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:38,919
to help your body recover.

333
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:40,679
How about I make you some soup?

334
00:15:40,799 --> 00:15:42,039
Rib soup, maybe?

335
00:15:42,879 --> 00:15:43,279
You

336
00:15:43,279 --> 00:15:44,720
shouldn't do anything for the next few days.

337
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:45,879
Just rest up.

338
00:15:55,399 --> 00:15:56,600
Have a glass of milk.

339
00:15:57,559 --> 00:15:58,399
Thank you, mom.

340
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:03,559
Still studying hard, huh?

341
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:11,919
What's up, mom?

342
00:16:13,559 --> 00:16:14,519
Tell me,

343
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:16,480
how much you love playing basketball.

344
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:23,279
Mom.

345
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,799
You used to say

346
00:16:25,799 --> 00:16:26,399
that whatever I do

347
00:16:26,399 --> 00:16:27,279
is like fulfilling

348
00:16:27,279 --> 00:16:28,440
my dad's expectations,

349
00:16:29,039 --> 00:16:30,799
only focusing on efficiency and results.

350
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,120
But basketball is different.

351
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:34,159
It's truly special.

352
00:16:35,039 --> 00:16:36,320
Just like you said,

353
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:37,720
like real reading.

354
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:40,519
I can feel

355
00:16:40,519 --> 00:16:41,279
every breath and heartbeat,

356
00:16:41,279 --> 00:16:43,039
every move and shot

357
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,799
on the court.

358
00:16:47,799 --> 00:16:49,120
Every minute,

359
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:50,639
I'm happy.

360
00:16:54,519 --> 00:16:55,720
Really happy.

361
00:17:02,519 --> 00:17:03,759
I see.

362
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:06,200
I understand.

363
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:09,920
But

364
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:10,839
your dad sent me

365
00:17:10,839 --> 00:17:12,279
a message today.

366
00:17:12,519 --> 00:17:13,759
His exchange program

367
00:17:13,759 --> 00:17:15,240
has ended early.

368
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,599
He'll be back this weekend.

369
00:17:20,319 --> 00:17:21,799
Since you like it so much,

370
00:17:22,079 --> 00:17:24,559
talk to him about it when he gets back.

371
00:17:28,759 --> 00:17:29,359
I'll prepare well

372
00:17:29,359 --> 00:17:30,799
for every game from now on

373
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:32,599
and prove it to him with results.

374
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:35,400
I'm not talking about grades.

375
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:37,839
I mean expressing your love.

376
00:17:38,319 --> 00:17:40,119
Tell him your feelings.

377
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:46,359
Mom,

378
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:49,000
do you support me in playing basketball?

379
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:50,759
Of course.

380
00:17:51,279 --> 00:17:52,720
As long as you're happy,

381
00:17:53,079 --> 00:17:54,160
even if you just

382
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,279
run around on the court

383
00:17:55,279 --> 00:17:56,640
all your life,

384
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:58,200
I'll be happy for you.

385
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:00,759
No.

386
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,920
My son should be

387
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:05,960
a rising star

388
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:08,519
on the track.

389
00:18:12,839 --> 00:18:13,960
But

390
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:16,119
I can understand your dad.

391
00:18:16,759 --> 00:18:18,680
After all, he's been there.

392
00:18:19,200 --> 00:18:21,240
He's asking you to do this

393
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:23,240
for your future.

394
00:18:29,279 --> 00:18:30,640
Don't be discouraged.

395
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:32,440
Cheer up.

396
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:33,920
You still have me.

397
00:18:34,839 --> 00:18:36,160
As long as you need,

398
00:18:36,599 --> 00:18:38,599
I will always be by your side.

399
00:18:38,839 --> 00:18:40,720
I will support you unconditionally

400
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:41,880
and your love.

401
00:18:47,079 --> 00:18:47,720
Mom.

402
00:18:49,519 --> 00:18:50,519
Thank you.

403
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:56,279
Okay, I won't bother you anymore.

404
00:18:56,279 --> 00:18:57,839
Drink the milk and go to bed early.

405
00:18:57,960 --> 00:18:58,480
Okay.

406
00:18:58,880 --> 00:18:59,680
Good night.

407
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,359
Good night, mom.

408
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:11,359
Should I

409
00:19:11,359 --> 00:19:12,519
play a good game,

410
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:14,799
or have a good talk

411
00:19:14,799 --> 00:19:15,799
with him?

412
00:19:36,319 --> 00:19:37,839
Team data analysis.

413
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,319
Didn't you

414
00:19:39,319 --> 00:19:40,720
quit the basketball team?

415
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:43,160
The team captain

416
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:44,279
got injured tonight,

417
00:19:45,079 --> 00:19:46,680
so I'm helping out with the analysis.

418
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:56,400
This level of detail

419
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:57,759
isn't something

420
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:59,039
you can do

421
00:19:59,039 --> 00:20:00,559
on a whim.

422
00:20:01,640 --> 00:20:02,799
Trying to fool me?

423
00:20:03,279 --> 00:20:04,720
You're still too young.

424
00:20:12,839 --> 00:20:13,559
Yan,

425
00:20:14,359 --> 00:20:15,680
I don't like beating around the bush.

426
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:17,480
I have to tell you,

427
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:19,640
I don't approve of you playing basketball again.

428
00:20:25,119 --> 00:20:25,880
I know.

429
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:29,680
But

430
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:31,519
I fully support you

431
00:20:31,759 --> 00:20:33,319
in your love for basketball.

432
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:36,319
Have you ever considered

433
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:38,000
finding another way

434
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:39,359
to return to the court?

435
00:20:42,400 --> 00:20:43,640
Another way?

436
00:20:45,720 --> 00:20:47,279
A data analyst

437
00:20:48,079 --> 00:20:49,240
Playing basketball on the court

438
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:50,359
is not the only way

439
00:20:50,359 --> 00:20:51,519
to show your love for basketball.

440
00:20:52,359 --> 00:20:53,960
You're good at

441
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,200
data analysis.

442
00:20:55,680 --> 00:20:57,279
You can return to the team

443
00:20:57,519 --> 00:20:59,279
in this way,

444
00:20:59,559 --> 00:21:01,160
and give full play to your strengths.

445
00:21:01,599 --> 00:21:02,599
What do you think?

446
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:08,839
If you don't like it, just forget it.

447
00:21:08,839 --> 00:21:10,240
If you like it, just do it.

448
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:12,920
The worst thing is to be hesitant

449
00:21:12,920 --> 00:21:14,079
and not do what you say.

450
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,119
That's not me.

451
00:21:17,119 --> 00:21:18,359
Fu Yuqing's son.

452
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:43,880
Coach Su

453
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:45,799
I have something to talk to you.

454
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:00,880
Coach Su

455
00:22:00,880 --> 00:22:01,599
What's wrong?

456
00:22:03,720 --> 00:22:04,160
Come on.

457
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:05,599
Start your show.

458
00:22:10,279 --> 00:22:11,200
I've decided

459
00:22:11,759 --> 00:22:13,559
to join the basketball club

460
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:15,000
as a data analyst.

461
00:22:26,119 --> 00:22:27,079
I've already talked to

462
00:22:27,079 --> 00:22:28,160
Director Qian.

463
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:29,160
Fu Binyan has officially

464
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:30,599
become one of us.

465
00:22:36,319 --> 00:22:38,720
Don't you agree?

466
00:22:39,759 --> 00:22:40,519
Agree!

467
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:43,440
We've been waiting for you for a long time.

468
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:44,359
But

469
00:22:44,359 --> 00:22:46,000
why are you just an analyst

470
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:47,759
as MVP?

471
00:22:47,759 --> 00:22:48,680
What a waste!

472
00:22:48,680 --> 00:22:49,640
Yeah.

473
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:50,960
It's better to play basketball.

474
00:22:50,960 --> 00:22:52,440
Yeah, let's play together.

475
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:53,279
You lead us to victory.

476
00:22:53,839 --> 00:22:55,279
Analysts are also important.

477
00:22:59,079 --> 00:23:00,559
What are you talking about?

478
00:23:01,599 --> 00:23:02,039
Okay.

479
00:23:02,839 --> 00:23:04,200
Fu Binyan as the analyst

480
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:06,680
can help Coach Su enrich the tactics,

481
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:08,480
and also help Gu Chenyang share the pressure.

482
00:23:08,720 --> 00:23:09,799
It's the best return.

483
00:23:10,960 --> 00:23:11,799
Well summarized.

484
00:23:12,480 --> 00:23:13,920
Alright, since you're here,

485
00:23:13,920 --> 00:23:15,559
the analyst should get ready.

486
00:23:15,559 --> 00:23:17,400
Observe everyone's condition,

487
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:18,079
and get familiar with it.

488
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:19,440
Come on, change clothes.

489
00:23:19,799 --> 00:23:21,240
Okay.

490
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:23,440
Welcome.

491
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:53,319
You know about him too?

492
00:23:54,039 --> 00:23:54,920
What about him?

493
00:24:01,000 --> 00:24:02,519
I thought I was the only one who knew.

494
00:24:02,519 --> 00:24:03,839
It's putting a lot of pressure on me.

495
00:24:03,960 --> 00:24:06,440
We didn't give anything away, did we?

496
00:24:09,720 --> 00:24:10,759
It was a bit forced,

497
00:24:10,759 --> 00:24:11,839
but it should be fine.

498
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:12,920
That's good.

499
00:24:13,359 --> 00:24:14,799
Now that we're on the same page,

500
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:16,119
let's work together from now on.

501
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:18,319
Or

502
00:24:18,559 --> 00:24:20,039
let's make up an excuse first.

503
00:24:20,559 --> 00:24:22,079
He has officially joined us.

504
00:24:22,079 --> 00:24:22,880
It's inevitable that

505
00:24:22,880 --> 00:24:24,279
he'll be asked to perform again.

506
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:25,759
It's better to be prepared in advance.

507
00:24:25,759 --> 00:24:26,680
Precaution is better than cure.

508
00:24:27,799 --> 00:24:28,920
It makes sense.

509
00:24:29,839 --> 00:24:31,880
What excuse should we make up?

510
00:24:31,880 --> 00:24:33,039
Let me help you.

511
00:24:34,599 --> 00:24:36,319
You two are talking so loudly

512
00:24:36,319 --> 00:24:37,480
that the whole school can hear you.

513
00:24:40,920 --> 00:24:42,880
But thank you anyway.

514
00:24:43,279 --> 00:24:44,640
I'll figure out a way to deal with

515
00:24:44,640 --> 00:24:46,160
this kind of situation by myself.

516
00:24:49,799 --> 00:24:50,640
Fu Binyan

517
00:24:51,680 --> 00:24:53,400
You suddenly decided to join the Basketball Club.

518
00:24:53,839 --> 00:24:55,559
Is it because my right hand is injured?

519
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:00,839
Don't get me wrong.

520
00:25:00,839 --> 00:25:01,920
I just

521
00:25:02,200 --> 00:25:03,440
want to join it.

522
00:25:07,240 --> 00:25:09,799
I hope you won't make me regret.

523
00:25:19,440 --> 00:25:20,720
You're still so proud.
